# Static, unrelaxed bcc energy at chosen nearest-neighbour distances r (a = 2r/sqrt3),
# to compare with the NIST EvsR.Fe.txt table for the same potential file.
units           metal
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic
variable        r index 2.40 2.44 2.48 2.4724
label           loop
variable        a equal 2.0*${r}/sqrt(3.0)
variable        a equal 2.0*2.40/sqrt(3.0)
lattice         bcc ${a}
lattice         bcc 2.7712812921102
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 2.7712813 2.7712813 2.7712813
region          box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (13.856406 13.856406 13.856406)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 250 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (13.856406 13.856406 13.856406)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds
mass            1 55.845
pair_style      eam/fs
pair_coeff      * * potentials/MCM2011_eam.fs Fe
thermo_style    custom pe press
run             0
WARNING: No fixes with time integration, atoms won't move
For more information see https://docs.lammps.org/err0028 (src/verlet.cpp:60)
